  "notes": "Similar to [r=9204847] but this version has slightly different text on the rear cover:\n\n\"Produced by Chris Thomas\n\nSTOP YOUR SOBBING\nProduced by Nick Lowe\"\n\nAlso that version displays different pressing rings under the labels: a deep groove ⅓ from the centre and a steep dip ⅔ from the centre.\n\nIssued in a card picture sleeve with card printed inner, custom black & white labels; most copies have a sticker on the front cover stating:\n\"Featuring The Singles 'Stop Your Sobbing' 'Kid' 'Brass In Pocket'\".\n\nOn labels:\nManufactured in the UK\n℗ 1980/1979*\n*A4, A6, A7, B1, B3\n[Publishers, all tracks]\nHynde House Of Hits/Modern Publishing/ATV Music Ltd.\n[except A7] Kassner Associated Publishers Ltd.\nOn rear cover:\n℗ 1979 A Real Recording distributed by wea Records Ltd. © A Warner Communications Co. (...) Printed and made in England.\n\nRunouts are etched. ",
  "released_formatted": "04 Jan 1980",
